  - Id: reveal_a
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d22b009a9dc50a2679df5e6754db9d3, type: 2}
    DialogueText: YES! Well, no.. they're just misunderstood.. Anyway, I tried to
      calm them down. I'd asked ChatJeeves LLM and.. well 3 hours laters I had the
      vape of all vapes in my palm. I was told it'd chill the oiks down but fucking
      hell old boy, they're anything but calm.
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: Alright cool. And you're telling me because?
      NextNodeId: ask_why_1
      QuestGate: 0
      QuestGateId: 
