  - Id: ask_why_1
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d22b009a9dc50a2679df5e6754db9d3, type: 2}
    DialogueText: I've spoken to Daniel, I know you can sling spells. I'll tell the
      federalis if you don't help me out old boy. Give me a hand and there's a few
      quid in it for you. Please! *eyes begin to tear up*
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: Well since you asked nicely, go on then.
