  - Id: wm_made
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d22b009a9dc50a2679df5e6754db9d3, type: 2}
    DialogueText: I made 'em. I asked the AI folks, and I made 'em myself. All my
      own parts, all my own bits. But why?
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: "Well, I just had a chat with Scrap Man, and he saw you out there
        with Ralph and Sanjeet. He said you were buying a weird box of Chinese vapes\u2014"
      NextNodeId: wm_thing
      QuestGate: 0
      QuestGateId: 
      QuestGateStage: 0
      RequiredStat: 
      RequiredStatLevel: 0
      RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
      RequiredItemQuantity: 1
