  - Id: wm_thing
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d22b009a9dc50a2679df5e6754db9d3, type: 2}
    DialogueText: No. Well, well, well, you see, the thing is...
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: What?
