  - Id: wm_toomuch
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d22b009a9dc50a2679df5e6754db9d3, type: 2}
    DialogueText: It was just too much, old boy. The place has been going down the
      tubes, and the Neeks, they were more and more rowdy. I just... I didn't know
      what to do.
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: Okay.
      NextNodeId: wm_experiment
      QuestGate: 0
      QuestGateId: 
      QuestGateStage: 0
      RequiredStat: 
      RequiredStatLevel: 0
      RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
      RequiredItemQuantity: 1
      ConsumeRequiredItem: 0
      GrantQuestId: 
      GrantQuestTitle: 
      GrantQuestObjective: 
      GrantQuestLocation: 
      TeachSpark: 0
      CompleteQuestId: 
