      MerchantAction: 0
      HireCompanionId: 
      HireCompanionFree: 0
      CompanionCommand: 0
  - Id: wm_experiment
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d22b009a9dc50a2679df5e6754db9d3, type: 2}
    DialogueText: "I didn't know what to do. So I've seen online that the Chinese,
      they've been using these vapes to sedate people, just make them comply. So
      I thought, okay, I'll do that. But I couldn't put it through the coffers \u2014
      the council would never sign off on it, and the people aren't gonna vote for
      it. So... it was my own personal money. And, well, it was just an experiment.
      That was it."
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: But Mosley, why did you involve the Chinese? You hate the Chinese.
      NextNodeId: wm_korean
      QuestGate: 0
      QuestGateId: 
      QuestGateStage: 0
      RequiredStat: 
      RequiredStatLevel: 0
      RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
      RequiredItemQuantity: 1
      ConsumeRequiredItem: 0
      GrantQuestId: 
      GrantQuestTitle: 
      GrantQuestObjective: 
      GrantQuestLocation: 
      TeachSpark: 0
      CompleteQuestId: 
      Merchant: {fileID: 0}
      MerchantAction: 0
      HireCompanionId: 
      HireCompanionFree: 0
      CompanionCommand: 0
  - Id: wm_korean
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d22b009a9dc50a2679df5e6754db9d3, type: 2}
    DialogueText: Well, I didn't know they were Chinese. They told me it was Korean.
      I asked, I said, this is Chinese, that looks Chinese. He said, don't be a racist
      mate, that's Korean. Who am I to question? He's, you know, he wasn't white.
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: Yeah, but Sanjeet, he sounds Indian or Pakistani. He doesn't sound
        like he's an authority on China, Japan, Korea, you know?
      NextNodeId: wm_same
      QuestGate: 0
      QuestGateId: 
      QuestGateStage: 0
      RequiredStat: 
